Z||000006||FieroMike||01-04-2000||09:07 PM||||Cliff,<BR>I could have sworn a long time ago when you first opened the site, there was a racing section.  Maybe it was just in the General Chat....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  I don't know if you have ever seen this site-www.ls1.com... They have the same software as you do, you might get some ideas.... but I think you are doing an awesome job all by yourself!  Ever thought of having a couple more Moderators?  TTYL<P>Kill Kill Kill!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I.E. "There was a 98GT Mustang, he pulled up to me, gave me a snotty look.  I looked over and revved.  He laughed.  He now knows how to spell "FIERO" since he watched it fly away..."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
